  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 16-layer planar dielectric stack on Si substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2 (16 finite layers). Initialize thicknesses at quarter-wave optical thickness for 10500 nm wavelength using HfO2 and SiO2 refractive indices in the 8-13 μm range. Allow all 16 thicknesses to vary during optimization with bounds 200-1800 nm. Evaluate spectral absorptance from 3000-13000 nm. Target: maximize absorptance in 8000-13000 nm, minimize absorptance in 3000-5000 nm. Include deterministic fallback: if stochastic optimizer yields valid_candidates=0, inject three periodic quarter-wave templates with 8, 10, and 12 layer pairs at 10500 nm center wavelength. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 3000-5000 nm, 8000-13000 nm. soft objectives: high emissivity in 8000-13000 nm; low emissivity in 3000-5000 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: high emissivity in 3000-5000 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count not exceeding 24.",
